Package: metatracker
Type: Package
Title: Lineage Tracking and Differential Expression Across Developmental Trajectories
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Dmitry Velmeshev", family = "TODO", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "TODO@example.com")
Description: Tools for isolating single-cell lineages from a monocle3 principal
    graph, filtering expressed genes, and running within-lineage and
    between-lineage differential expression with tradeSeq, including
    branch-point detection, branch labelling, and trajectory visualisation.
    Extends the monocle3 'cell_data_set' class with slots for lineages,
    graphs, pseudotime, expression, and differential-expression results.
